<p>South African President Cyril Ramaphosa has appointed veteran politician Roelf Meyer as ambassador to the United States, filling a post that had stood vacant since last year and signaling an effort to steady a strained bilateral relationship. Meyer, 78, is best known as the National Party’s chief negotiator in the talks that helped end apartheid, where he worked opposite Ramaphosa during South Africa’s democratic transition. The appointment follows months of friction between Pretoria and Washington. South Africa’s previous ambassador in Washington, Ebrahim Rasool, was expelled in March 2025 after criticizing the Trump administration and the MAGA movement during a webinar, leaving the mission without a top envoy as tensions worsened. Several reports say Pretoria hopes Meyer’s stature, negotiating experience, and credibility across political divides can help reopen channels with President Trump’s administration, as disagreements have widened to include domestic race policy, South Africa’s BRICS ties, and its case against Israel at the International Court of Justice.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/FW1blTBxBM1OclrfFsGt_6sU1ZchbZJKAthaZ0KJDSnp9f8r_l0QvSJ2KVmK_A_sHtrRiWWpJ50GmnSBc1rCOGYqm3tzN0Fhk99qaVU2zryouHJRDIhJwh3YsWtrkQR0xKzyD8_Hhn6hx2vpKiYnKeefh1c0kNWN4NE6rddO99GGGpik-yBjDJMacVsgw5814qIe7EC1ui6Gnh3XS1pCIJ_8cQV5mQ' alt='Roelf Meyer, center, with President Cyril Ramaphosa of South Africa to his right at an event in Pretoria in August. Mr. Meyer was appointed ambassador to the United States on Wednesday.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Afrikaner signal: By choosing one of South Africa’s most recognizable Afrikaner political elders, Pretoria appears to be betting that Meyer’s profile matters in Washington, not just the diplomatic task ahead.</li><li>Rasool flashpoint: Reports say the rupture deepened after former ambassador Ebrahim Rasool told a webinar that the Maga movement was partly a response “to a supremacist instinct,” a remark cited as the immediate trigger for his expulsion.</li><li>G20 spillover: South African Finance Minister Enoch Godongwana and Reserve Bank Governor Lesetja Kganyago were barred from this week’s G20 finance meeting in Washington, a sign that tensions are affecting broader official contact beyond the embassy post.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>South African presidency: Ramaphosa’s office confirmed Meyer’s appointment and, as cited by RT, cast him as a bridge figure from the constitutional era who is committed to a non-racial South Africa. (<a href='https://www.rt.com/africa/638443-south-africa-appoints-former-apartheid-era-minister-us-envoy/'>RT</a>)</li><li>South African officials and allies: Coverage suggests Pretoria sees the U.S. relationship as work for a heavyweight political dealmaker, not a routine diplomatic posting, which helps explain the choice of Meyer for a role that has become unusually sensitive. (<a href='https://www.semafor.com/article/04/15/2026/south-africa-turns-to-afrikaner-as-ambassador-to-us'>Semafor</a>)</li><li>Analysts in coverage: Multiple outlets read the appointment as an attempt to improve ties while pushing back on U.S. allegations about a &#x27;white genocide,&#x27; which reporting describes as false. (<a href='https://www.dw.com/en/south-africa-appoints-veteran-afrikaner-politician-roelf-meyer-as-us-ambassador-amid-tense-trump-ties/a-76794872'>Deutsche Welle</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://allafrica.com/stories/202604150109.html'>South Africa: Roelf Meyer Appointed South Africa&#x27;s New Ambassador to the U.S.</a> - allafrica.com</li><li><a href='https://www.dw.com/en/south-africa-appoints-veteran-afrikaner-politician-roelf-meyer-as-us-ambassador-amid-tense-trump-ties/a-76794872'>South Africa appoints veteran Afrikaner politician Roelf Meyer as US ambassador amid tense Trump ties</a> - dw.com</li><li><a href='https://www.semafor.com/article/04/15/2026/south-africa-turns-to-afrikaner-as-ambassador-to-us'>South Africa turns to Afrikaner as ambassador to US</a> - semafor.com</li><li><a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/cwyjjjz8n8ko'>South Africa names apartheid-era politician as new ambassador to the US</a> - bbc.com</li><li><a href='https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/apr/15/south-africa-names-ambassador-us-roelf-meyer'>South Africa names apartheid-era negotiator as ambassador to US</a> - theguardian.com</li><li><a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/04/15/world/africa/south-africa-us-ambassador-roelf-meyer.html'>South Africa Names Roelf Meyer, Apartheid-Era Negotiator, as U.S. Ambassador</a> - nytimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.rt.com/africa/638443-south-africa-appoints-former-apartheid-era-minister-us-envoy/'>South Africa appoints ex-apartheid-era minister as US envoy</a> - rt.com</li></ul>